  "prefLabel": "Gen 407.01 Administrative Obligations of Licensees",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Gen 407.01 Administrative Obligations of Licensees.\n\n(a) Plc 307 shall govern the administrative obligations of licensees.\n\n(b) Licensees shall retain documentation of their continuing professional education and professional activities for at least 3 years.\n\n(c) Licensees shall cooperate with all investigations and requests for information from the OPLC and the board, wherein “cooperate” means to:\n\n(1) Provide accurate factual information;\n\n(2) Respond to any questions posed in a timely fashion; and\n\n(3) Assist in any other way requested by the OPLC or the board.\n\nSource. #10687, eff 10-7-14; renumbered by #13556 (formerly Gen 408.01) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Gen 400); ss by #14338, eff 10-7-25, EXPIRES: 10-7-35\n\nAPPENDIX",
